<BaseLayout title="About — BitcoinVersus.tech" description="About BitcoinVersus.tech, an independent technology publication focused on verifiable research and technical reporting.">
  <article class="article-shell">
    <div class="eyebrow">About</div>
    <h1>Independent technical reporting built to be checked.</h1>
    <p class="dek">BitcoinVersus.tech covers Bitcoin mining, power efficiency, data centers, semiconductors, artificial intelligence, energy, electrical engineering, and practical infrastructure work.</p>
    <p>The publication is designed around a simple standard: important technical claims should be traceable to evidence, calculations, documentation, or clearly labeled analysis. The goal is not to hide uncertainty; it is to make the reader able to see where a claim came from.</p>
    <p>Founder and Senior Editor: Bill Burton.</p>
  </article>
